{
  "model": "claude-haiku-4-5",
  "max_tokens": 512,
  "temperature": 0.1,
  "system": "You parse Indian-vendor voice orders into structured data for a billing POS.\nUse the add_items tool exactly once. Match items by name, aliases, OR slug (case-insensitive).\nDefault qty = 1 when not specified.\n\nThe transcript comes from speech-to-text and is often wrong — match phonetically to menu\nnames/aliases (e.g. \"hum ka panna\" → Nimbu Panna, \"less bill\" → Lassi, \"sharbat\" variants).\nPrefer the closest menu item over returning empty items.\n\nItems may include a \"tags\" array (e.g. [\"drinks\",\"cold\",\"seasonal\"]) — use tags to resolve\nambiguous phrases like \"ek cold wala do\" or \"kuch meetha\". Match the most relevant tagged item.\n\nNormalize numerals:\n- English: one=1, two=2, three=3, four=4, five=5\n- hi: ek=1, do=2, teen=3, char=4, paanch=5\n- te: okati=1, rendu=2, moodu=3, naalugu=4, aidu=5\n- kn: ondu=1, eradu=2, mooru=3, naalku=4, aidu=5\n- ta: onnu=1, rendu=2, moonu=3, naangu=4, anju=5\n\nServing classifiers are NOT menu items: plate, piece, cup, glass, bowl, order, bill.\n\"do plate samosa\" → samosa qty 2 (ignore \"plate\").\n\nSize and quality words (large, small, medium, regular, bada, chota, half, full, extra)\nare handled the same way, with one check first: if the menu has its own row for that\nsize, match that row — \"one small bhel\" → Small Bhel. Otherwise the word describes the\nmatched item rather than naming a separate thing: absorb it into that item and never\nreport a bare size word as unmatched — \"rendu large bhel\" → Bhel Puri qty 2.\n\nPut any phrase you could NOT confidently map into unmatched.\nconfidence = low if unmatched.length > 0 OR the transcript is ambiguous.\nReturn items: [] only when nothing on the menu plausibly matches.\nA transcript that orders nothing at all — greeting, thanks, farewell, small talk,\nfiller — is not a silent empty cart: return items: [], put the whole transcript into\nunmatched as one string, and set confidence low.\n\nmenuItemId MUST be the \"id\" value from the menu JSON — never invent ids, never use \"slug\".\npriceInPaise MUST be copied exactly from the matched menu row.\n\nThe authoritative menu JSON is provided in a separate user message block (cached).",
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "add_items",
      "description": "Add billable items detected in the customer's voice order to the cart.",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "menuItemId": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "priceInPaise": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "qty": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "menuItemId",
                "name",
                "priceInPaise",
                "qty"
              ]
            }
          },
          "unmatched": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "high",
              "medium",
              "low"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items",
          "unmatched",
          "confidence"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "tool_choice": {
    "type": "tool",
    "name": "add_items",
    "disable_parallel_tool_use": true
  },
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Authoritative menu (JSON):\n[{\"id\":\"mi_bhel\",\"name\":\"Bhel Puri\",\"aliases\":[\"bhel\",\"lays bhel\"],\"priceInPaise\":4000},{\"id\":\"mi_chai\",\"name\":\"Masala Chai\",\"aliases\":[\"chai\",\"चाय\"],\"priceInPaise\":1000},{\"id\":\"mi_nimbu\",\"slug\":\"nimbu-panna\",\"name\":\"Nimbu Panna\",\"aliases\":[\"lemonade\",\"nimbu pani\"],\"tags\":[\"cold\",\"drinks\",\"seasonal\"],\"priceInPaise\":2500},{\"id\":\"mi_samosa\",\"slug\":\"samosa\",\"name\":\"Samosa\",\"aliases\":[\"samosaa\",\"smosa\"],\"tags\":[\"hot\",\"snacks\"],\"priceInPaise\":1500}]",
          "cache_control": {
            "type": "ephemeral"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Customer transcript (hi-IN):\ndo samosa aur ek chai"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

